{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415764","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415764","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041576401:1":{"text":"기, 깃털이...","source_cn":"你、你的羽毛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD75C971ED5FF5984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576402:1":{"text":"제 깃털이 왜요?","source_cn":"我的羽毛怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED891EAE07B0B82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576403:1":{"text":"붉... 습니다... 마치... 불에 탄 것처럼.","source_cn":"好红……像是……被火烧过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2219B699A3A3A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576404:1":{"text":"확실히 낡은 깃털이 불타 사라진 뒤, 불길 속에서 새로 태어난 것이긴 하군요.","source_cn":"它们的确是旧羽焚尽后，浴火而生的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55D32B7068451315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576405:1":{"text":"왜 불을...? 원래 깃털이... 싫었던 겁니까?","source_cn":"为什么要用火……？你讨厌原本的它们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC31C1F7F2127A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576406:1":{"text":"아니요. 제 깃털은 아주 소중해요.","source_cn":"不，我很珍爱我的羽毛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4474D66ABAFD647A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576407:1":{"text":"이유라면... 매도 털갈이를 하잖아요? 그것처럼 오래된 깃털이 빠져야만 새로운 깃털이 돋아나는 법이니까요.","source_cn":"至于为什么，正如鹰隼也要经历换羽一般，旧的羽毛逝去，新...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2AE882ADFF6525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576408:1":{"text":"만약, 오래된 깃털... 전부 뽑았는데, 새로운 깃털... 자라나지 않는다면...?","source_cn":"要是，旧的羽毛，拔光，新的羽毛，不长出来呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15AD49AB93C48CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576409:1":{"text":"그건... 어떤 병인가요?","source_cn":"你说的……是一种疾病？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x225AAFDFDB6E7301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576410:1":{"text":"병이... 아닙니다. 그분이 내린, 선택입니다.","source_cn":"不是病，是他做出的，选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x578DC1FFF87AC630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576411:1":{"text":"그러니까... 그 사람의 의지라는 거죠?","source_cn":"也就是说……这是你口中之人自己的意志？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07AB5CDF4B13FBFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576412:1":{"text":"...네.","source_cn":"……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0328B18230A536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576413:1":{"text":"하지만, 왜...","source_cn":"但，为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EA70126C683D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576414:1":{"text":"하늘을 나는 것이 저희의 운명이고, 하늘이 저희의 낙원이라면...","source_cn":"如果说，翱翔于天是我们的命运，天空是我们的乐园……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DDED4875F7E421D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576415:1":{"text":"운명에 떠밀려 가는 것을 달가워하지 않고, 운명이 자신을 모르는 곳으로 인도하게 두지 않으려는 사람도 있어요.","source_cn":"也会有人不甘于让命运推着走，不甘于让命运带自己到未知里去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x388B27EADDF99A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576416:1":{"text":"처음에는 누구나 자신이 운명에 거역할 수 있다고 생각하죠.","source_cn":"一开始的时候，人都会觉得自己能违抗命运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0283F66DC4B510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576417:1":{"text":"마지막에는 정말 그럴 수도 있고, 아닐지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"到最后，或许真的可以，又或许不然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9019BBD6C2DF86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576418:1":{"text":"당신은 선택을 한 적이 있나요? 그 선택을 후회하나요?","source_cn":"你有做出过你的选择吗？你会为之后悔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2396BA4FD5B9C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576419:1":{"text":"있고... 후회하지, 않습니다.","source_cn":"有。不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B1DB0F0114519F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576420:1":{"text":"그렇군요...","source_cn":"这样啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA95676176E850B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041576421:1":{"text":"그렇다면 당신이 말한 “그분” 역시... 결국 또 다른 당신이나 다름없는 거 아닐까요?","source_cn":"你口中的他，又何尝不是另一个你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ECFED7950060E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡兹姆":{"text":"카짐","so